  Category: 2
  Prefab: {fileID: 6625514644646704096, guid: 1f6a6789373206e498f996cb54aeedb1, type: 3}
  Interactable: {fileID: 5048261325816738630, guid: 1f6a6789373206e498f996cb54aeedb1, type: 3}
  TextFields:
  - 
  - "Astrid\u2014\n\nBig news! I talked to my editor. You're officially hired! I
    mean, if you want the job. No pressure, but seriously... I think people would
    love this. We\u2019ve all been scared for so long. We need something to get excited
    about. I could see this being a regular column. Maybe even a radio show\u2014now
    that would make a difference! (I know, I know... wishful thinking. The bandwidths
    are SO overregulated by the Recovery Board! Feels like Big Brother.)\n\nIf it
    helps, you could even work here while going to school. The university is opening
    up again! \n\nAny more info on that crazy meteor storm? By the time you get this
    letter, the paper will probably have already gone to print. But that\u2019s ok,
    there\u2019s always next month. \n"
  - "Your future coworker :) ... I hope. \nJocelyn"
